{"type":"text","timestamp":1778979834895,"sessionID":"ses_1cc8acd6dffephn30ptdQ0bam5","part":{"id":"prt_e3375f4fd001fr9PYTdhBQosfB","messageID":"msg_e3375cb34001upmfUev29DI6E5","sessionID":"ses_1cc8acd6dffephn30ptdQ0bam5","type":"text","text":"The ontology already has `granulomatous hypophysitis` as a separate child of `hypophysitis`, and the three anatomical terms are currently modeled as direct children of `primary hypophysitis` with lymphocytic synonyms. The issue comments support a cleaner model: create a distinct `lymphocytic hypophysitis` child, move `autoimmune hypophysitis` there as a synonym, and reparent the three anatomical variants beneath it.","time":{"start":1778979828989,"end":1778979834892}}}
